    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449310/extras/ca69f0a58bf202cc89876c67e0815ebd.poster.avif?t=1691001427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449310/extras/ca69f0a58bf202cc89876c67e0815ebd.webm?t=1691001427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Help time-traveling residents power their apartments</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> You will finish a sentence about your friend.<br></li><li> Your friend will confirm how true it is for themselves.<br><br><strong>The strength of your friendship will generate electricity.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449310/extras/0c430661340d388223c764011a000901.poster.avif?t=1691001427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449310/extras/0c430661340d388223c764011a000901.webm?t=1691001427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449310/extras/0c430661340d388223c764011a000901.mp4?t=1691001427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayability</h2>There are <strong>660+</strong> fun, light-hearted questions hand-crafted to create the best experience for you. They aim to be replayable and to give you a plethora of enjoyable topics to talk about.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endings</h2>There are <strong>nine endings</strong> - each flavored with a Time Travelling reward. You may need a lot of practice and knowledge about your friend to earn the <strong>highest one</strong>. You will be rewarded with our only Steam achievement by doing so. Don't give up!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449310/extras/5ec0fdffa64be95ed953c4b702cda1d8.avif?t=1691001427\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Disclaimer</h2>&quot;Breaking Friendships&quot; could alter friendships. We take full credit for all the friendships strengthened by it and none of the responsibilities for all the ones that might fail. Proceed with caution.<br><br><br>Please watch the <strong>Introduction video</strong> (above) for full information on <i>how to play</i>, <i>bonuses</i>, and <i>progression</i>.</li></ul>",
