s://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449310/extras/5ec0fdffa64be95ed953c4b702cda1d8.avif?t=1691001427\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Disclaimer</h2>&quot;Breaking Friendships&quot; could alter friendships. We take full credit for all the friendships strengthened by it and none of the responsibilities for all the ones that might fail. Proceed with caution.<br><br><br>Please watch the <strong>Introduction video</strong> (above) for full information on <i>how to play</i>, <i>bonuses</i>, and <i>progression</i>.</li></ul>",
